<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS6" title="In 4.3. Ablation Study ‣ 4. Experiments ‣ OpenAVS: Training-Free Open-Vocabulary Audio Visual Segmentation with Foundational Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.3.6 </span>Evaluation of self-training AVS with different backbones</span></a></li>
